\code{n_perm = 0} (Bonferroni) instead.
\item Region boundaries are limited by the grid resolution; sub-grid
localization requires interpolation and is not done here.
\item For very large grids (>1000 points) the Bonferroni adjustment
becomes extremely conservative; permutation is recommended.
